# Read by stow when run from this directory. Options here apply to plain
# `stow <pkg>` invocations as well as ./bootstrap.
#
# stow's built-in ignore list already covers .git, README.*, LICENSE.*, and
# editor backups, but not our other in-package docs — without this, `stow tmux`
# cheerfully symlinks ~/ARCHITECTURE.md into $HOME.
--ignore=ARCHITECTURE\.md
